<!doctype html><html lang="en"><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width"><title>LineClash match and replay</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="viewer.css"><nav><a href="./">← Server directory</a></nav><h1>Match &amp; replay</h1><p id="status">Loading match…</p><div id="summary"></div><div class="scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>Player</th><th>Placement</th><th>Lines</th><th>Specials</th><th>Blocks</th></tr></thead><tbody id="players"></tbody></table></div><h2>Gameplay replay</h2><p>Server-recorded board snapshots and public game events. This is an inspection aid, not proof that a match was cheat-free. Partial traces are labelled.</p><p><button id="play" disabled>Play</button> <select id="speed" aria-label="Playback speed"><option value="0.5">0.5×</option><option selected value="1">1×</option><option value="2">2×</option><option value="4">4×</option></select> <span id="time"></span> <a id="download">Download replay</a></p><input id="seek" aria-label="Replay position" type="range" min="0" max="0" value="0" step="1"><canvas id="board" width="1008" height="440" aria-label="Recorded player boards"></canvas><pre id="events"></pre><script src="replay.js" defer></script></html>
